+## Usage reporting across tool rounds
+
+`afterModelResponse` receives the accumulated sum of `UsageMetadata` across every provider call for the turn, so a deployer recording usage for billing or audit captures the full cost of a tool-heavy turn, not only its final leg. The sum covers `inputTokens`, `outputTokens`, and `totalTokens`; a round that reports no usage is skipped rather than zeroing the total.
